# Later onboarding (do not skip)

After the current onboarding (name → feelings → voice → home), add screens **before Home**:

1. **Login / account** — the person needs to be signed in.
2. **Notification permission** — Future Self cannot wake them without iOS/Android alert access. Ask clearly, then deep-link to system settings if denied.

Do not pretend a sound picker controls the iPhone Clock app. The alarm is the cloned voice via notifications; a chime-before-voice picker can come later, bundled in the app.
